# This file marks THE struct2flow blueprint itself.
#
# It exists so `blueprint drift` can tell "I am the source of truth" from "I am a
# derived project", positively and without guessing (BUG-013).
#
# It must NEVER reach a derived project, and two independent mechanisms ensure
# that: it is `export-ignore` in .gitattributes (so `git archive` — which
# new-project.sh bootstraps from — omits it), and it is absent from MANAGED_FILES
# (so `blueprint pull` never copies it). A derived project therefore cannot have
# this file, even one whose .blueprint-source was deleted.
#
# Do not add it to MANAGED_FILES. Do not remove the export-ignore line.
